{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jalaram-heights/268323/project","title":"Jalaram Heights, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n\n# Jalaram Heights Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Price on Request**\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## Jalaram Heights Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Jalaram Heights.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  720 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nJalaram Heights's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Jalaram Heights | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 23800 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 25000 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 22550 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 0 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nJalaram Heights avg. price is ₹ 23.8 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon/7398/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon\") | ₹ 34,750 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Astron](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-astron/8730/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Astron\") | ₹ 31,400 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-sarova/10427/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova\") | ₹ 26,250 |\n| Current Project **Jalaram Heights** | ₹ 23,800 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Jalaram Heights | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Jalaram Heights.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Jalaram Heights moved from ₹ 22,550/sqft to ₹ 25,000/sqft, reflecting a 10.86% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Jalaram Heights moved from ₹ 17,350/sqft to ₹ 22,550/sqft, reflecting a 29.97% rise.\n\n## Jalaram Heights Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 720 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Jalaram Heights, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Rental Listings in Jalaram Heights\n\nExplore rental listings currently available in Jalaram Heights, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK + Store Room Apartment For Rent in Jalaram Heights in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nHighrise Property Consultants\n\nHighrise Property Consultants\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Jalaram Heights\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-indoorga-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Jalaram Heights.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Gokhale Education Society\n\n#### Pandya Hospital\n\n#### Richfeel Trichology Center\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Jalaram Heights\n\n## How does Jalaram Heights compare with similar projects?\n\n![Jalaram Heights project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-jalaram-heights-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Jalaram Heights](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jalaram-heights/268323/project \"Jalaram Heights\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon projec